{'symbol': 'CMS', 'date': '2022-05-18 06:00:00', 'title': 'CONSUMERS ENERGY BUILDING A BRIGHTER ENERGY FUTURE WITH AGREEMENTS TO PURCHASE SOLAR ENERGY IN GENESEE, HILLSDALE COUNTIES', 'text': 'TWO NEW PROJECTS IN 2024 WILL POWER 150,000 HOMES JACKSON, MICH. , MAY 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CONSUMERS ENERGY TODAY ANNOUNCED AGREEMENTS TO ADD 300 MEGAWATTS OF CLEAN ENERGY – ENOUGH TO POWER ABOUT 150,000 HOMES -- FROM TWO MICHIGAN SOLAR PROJECTS BEING DEVELOPED IN GENESEE AND HILLSDALE COUNTIES.'}